<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#5f4788; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<span style="background-color: rgb(95, 71, 136); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px;">Dear Patron,</span><br style="background-color: rgb(95, 71, 136); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px;"><br style="background-color: rgb(95, 71, 136); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px;"><span style="background-color: rgb(95, 71, 136); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px;">We would like to take this opportunity to welcome you to the array of our esteemed customers and feel deeply humbled for the trust you have placed in our organization.</span><br style="background-color: rgb(95, 71, 136); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px;"><br style="background-color: rgb(95, 71, 136); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px;"><span style="background-color: rgb(95, 71, 136); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px;">At Monster.com, we pride ourselves in offering responsive, competent and scalable recruitment solutions to help you find better and leverage your company’s core asset -&nbsp;</span><em style="background-color: rgb(95, 71, 136); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px;">YOUR PEOPLE.&nbsp;</em><span style="background-color: rgb(95, 71, 136); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px;">We foster this commitment through our excellent services and support, coordinated by a steering team dedicated to your account.</span><br style="background-color: rgb(95, 71, 136); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px;"><br style="background-color: rgb(95, 71, 136); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px;"><span style="background-color: rgb(95, 71, 136); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px;">Your Customer Service Representative is ______</span><br style="background-color: rgb(95, 71, 136); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px;"><br style="background-color: rgb(95, 71, 136); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px;"><span style="background-color: rgb(95, 71, 136); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px;">For business related queries or suggestions, please get in touch with our Customer Service Team or your respective Sales Representative.</span><br style="background-color: rgb(95, 71, 136); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px;"><br style="background-color: rgb(95, 71, 136); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px;"><span style="background-color: rgb(95, 71, 136); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px;">Thank you for choosing us. Looking forward to a great business association with you.</span><br style="background-color: rgb(95, 71, 136); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px;"><br style="background-color: rgb(95, 71, 136); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px;"><span style="background-color: rgb(95, 71, 136); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px;">Sincerely,</span><br style="background-color: rgb(95, 71, 136); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px;"><span style="background-color: rgb(95, 71, 136); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px;">Team Monster</span>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>
</td>
